{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンモスフリーマーケットライブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新衣装で登場したよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです！\nこれは4thアンダー曲\n「春のメロディー」の衣装♪\nマンモスフリーマーケットで\n初披露でしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼\n昨日メンバーがネタバレしてたね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂らしくレトロな花柄と\n大きいパフスリーブがかわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紫、水色、緑とね。\n全部で3色なんだけどね...\n私は.........緑だよ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前散々緑について話してたけど\n今日も緑だよ！テンション上がるぜ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あ、なんかこれじゃ\n緑色だいすき人間\nみたいになってるけど、\n他にも好きな色はたくさんあります！\nむしろ全色すきです！\nマイブームが緑なだけです！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪走れ！Bicycle\n♪ぐるぐるカーテン→さゆにゃん\n♪狼に口笛を\n♪左胸の勇気\n♪春のメロディー\n♪会いたかったかもしれない\n♪おいでシャンプー→生駒ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回だけだったけど、\nすごい盛り上がった！\nみなさんの一体感に感動！\n特においシャン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり声援が届きました; ;\n嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディーは\n制服のマネキンとはまた違った\n乃木坂46の王道！って感じで、\n爽やかで可愛らしい感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フォーメーションは\nたくさん入れ替わります。\n上下どっちにも動くよ！\nサビの三角形は3列目の下手端です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち見で後ろにいた方は\n見えずらかったかな。\n全握で披露するのが楽しみです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別とかで帽子かぶらんの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回だけかぶったよー！\nじゃあまた帽子ありコーデに\nしようかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーディガンの下に着てる洋服\n気になるんだけど絵柄の人物は誰？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫面人間。\n顔はネコ科の動物で\nからだは人間がきれいに2列 笑\nシュールですき。下北で買いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真をあつめられるのって\nうれしい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいから、写り良くなるように\n頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生姜をどんな形で食べてるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生姜すってホットレモンに入れたり\nドライ生姜やチップス買ったりして\nなるべく食べるようにしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエット方法教えて下さい♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日マッサージかなー\n間食しないだとか。\nそんなすごいダイエットは\nしてないけど意識するようにしてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服ってズボンが多いけど\nスカートはあんまり履かない？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せてる私服がたまたま\nズボンなだけだよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースだいすきだよ。な\nまた載せます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買い物、どこのお店でしてるん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下北沢原宿高円寺が多いかな。\n古着屋さんすきー^^\nあ、ラフォーレもけっこう行くよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何人兄弟？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人兄妹！\n一個上の兄ちゃんがいるぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フリマとか行く？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい興味あるんだけど、\n行ったことないんだ！\n今日ちょっとでも見たかったな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"襟に付いてるレースもかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は似顔絵会。\n上手く描けるかな？楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてBLTカレンダーお渡し会です！\n私はJ列でまいまい、みさみさと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6202338/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼お待ちしてます！／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉にとって最後のイベントです。\n一緒に楽しもう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}